{"ticker":"ETN","updated":"2026-11-06T23:52:58Z","profile":{"longName":"Eaton Corporation plc","shortName":"Eaton Corporation, PLC","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Specialty Industrial Machinery","country":"Ireland","website":"https://www.eaton.com","fullTimeEmployees":97303,"marketCap":132758216704,"trailingPE":34.137863,"forwardPE":20.973886,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":4.1507697,"pegRatio":1.99,"targetMeanPrice":480.54886,"targetHighPrice":534.0,"targetLowPrice":333.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":26,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.28,"earningsGrowth":0.07,"grossMargins":0.35154998,"operatingMargins":0.1785,"profitMargins":0.12184,"totalRevenue":31984001024,"beta":1.139,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":478.0,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":311.92,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.35},"summary":"Eaton Corporation plc operates as a power management company in the United States, Canada, Latin America, Europe, and the Asia Pacific. It operates through Electrical Americas, Electrical Global, Aerospace, Vehicle, and eMobility segments. The company offers electrical and industrial components, power distribution and assemblies, residential products, single- and three-phase power quality and connectivity products, wiring devices, circuit protection products, utility power distribution products, and power reliability equipment; and hazardous duty electrical equipment, emergency lighting, fire detection, intrinsically safe explosion-proof instrumentation, and structural support systems. It also provides pumps, motors, hydraulic power units, hoses and fittings, and electro-hydraulic pumps; valves, cylinders, electronic controls, electromechanical actuators, sensors, aircraft flap and slat systems, and nose wheel steering systems; hose and thermoplastic tubing products, fittings, adapters, couplings, and sealing and ducting products; air-to-air refueling systems, fuel pumps, fuel inerting products, sensors, and adapters and regulators; oxygen generation systems, payload carriages, and thermal management products; wiring connectors and cables; and hydraulic and bag filters, strainers and cartridges, and golf grips for manufacturers of commercial and military aircraft, related after","summary_zh":"伊頓公司是一家電源管理公司，業務遍及美國、加拿大、拉丁美洲、歐洲和亞太地區。該公司透過 Electrical Americas、Electrical Global、航空航太、車輛和電動交通部門運作。該公司提供電氣和工業元件、配電和組件、住宅產品、單相和三相電能品質和連接產品、接線設備、電路保護產品、公用配電產品和電力可靠性設備；危險工作電氣設備、緊急照明、火災偵測、本質安全防爆儀表和結構支撐系統。它還提供泵浦、馬達、液壓動力裝置、軟管和配件以及電動液壓泵；閥門、氣缸、電子控制裝置、機電執行器、感測器、飛機襟翼和縫翼系統以及前輪轉向系統；軟管和熱塑性管材產品、配件、適配器、接頭以及密封和管道產品；空對空加油系統、燃油泵、燃油惰化產品、感測器、適配器和調節器；制氧系統、有效載荷車廂和熱管理產品；接線連接器和電纜；以及商用和軍用飛機製造商的液壓和袋式過濾器、過濾器和濾筒以及高爾夫球握把，相關後","sector_zh":"工業","industry_zh":"特種工業機械","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-08","o":350.0,"h":352.58,"l":347.77,"c":349.49,"v":1632000},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":349.94,"h":350.27,"l":343.64,"c":348.23,"v":1763300},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":359.59,"h":365.43,"l":357.0,"c":362.25,"v":3484000},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":363.68,"h":365.31,"l":359.38,"c":360.08,"v":2253200},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":359.93,"h":367.68,"l":358.78,"c":365.9,"v":3108400},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":370.02,"h":378.16,"l":369.19,"c":375.54,"v":3031500},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":378.0,"h":378.98,"l":369.65,"c":371.19,"v":2251100},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":370.59,"h":371.46,"l":359.28,"c":363.35,"v":3481400},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":366.98,"h":374.06,"l":364.45,"c":371.27,"v":1857900},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":373.6,"h":375.36,"l":369.98,"c":374.5,"v":3483100},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":374.08,"h":382.92,"l":371.92,"c":378.31,"v":2399300},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":381.76,"h":382.0,"l":366.06,"c":368.52,"v":2776200},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":369.82,"h":373.62,"l":368.22,"c":372.21,"v":2290800},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":366.86,"h":368.16,"l":360.34,"c":364.74,"v":2029100},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":365.01,"h":366.51,"l":360.27,"c":365.58,"v":1625400},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":370.01,"h":370.98,"l":367.02,"c":367.15,"v":1466300},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":366.45,"h":374.99,"l":366.45,"c":374.25,"v":1805800},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":369.66,"h