"count":4},{"name":"分析師評等","count":2},{"name":"減重藥/生技","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-26","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1551182/000155118226000007/etn-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Eaton Corporation plc (Eaton or the Company) is an intelligent power management company dedicated to protecting the environment and improving the quality of life for people everywhere. We make products for the data center, utility, industrial, commercial, machine building, residential, aerospace and mobility markets. We are capitalizing on the megatrends of the electrification, digitalization, and the reindustrialization of and growth of megaprojects in North America and increased global infrastructure spending, all of which are expanding our end markets and positioning Eaton for growth for years to come. We are strengthening our participation across the entire electrical power value chain and benefiting from momentum in the data center and utility end markets as well as a growth cycle in the commercial aerospace and defense markets. We are guided by our commitment to operate sustainably","zh":"伊頓公司（伊頓或公司）是一家智慧電力管理公司，致力於保護環境和提高世界各地人們的生活品質。我們為資料中心、公用事業、工業、商業、機器製造、住宅、航空航太和行動市場生產產品。我們正在利用北美電氣化、數位化、再工業化和大型專案成長的大趨勢，以及全球基礎設施支出的增加，所有這些都在擴大我們的終端市場，並為伊頓在未來幾年的成長做好準備。我們正在加強對整個電力價值鏈的參與，並受益於資料中心和公用事業終端市場的勢頭以及商業航空航太和國防市場的成長週期。我們以可持續經營的承諾為指導"},{"en":"Founded in 1911, Eaton has continuously evolved to meet the changing and expanding needs of our stakeholders. With revenues of $27.4 billion in 2025, the Company serves customers in 180 countries.","zh":""},{"en":"Eaton electronically files or furnishes reports pursuant to Section 13(a) or 15(d) of the Securities Exchange Act of 1934 (Exchange Act) to the United States Securities and Exchange Commission (SEC), including annual reports on Form 10-K, quarterly reports on Form 10-Q, current reports on Form 8-K, and proxy and information statements, as well as any amendments to those reports. As soon as reasonably practicable, these reports are available free of charge through the Company's website at www.eaton.com. These filings are also accessible on the SEC's website at www.sec.gov.","zh":"伊頓根據 1934 年《證券交易法》（《交易法》）第 13(a) 或 15(d) 條以電子方式向美國證券交易委員會 (SEC) 提交或提供報告，包括表格 10-K 中的年度報告、表格 10-Q 中的季度報告、表格 8-K 中的修訂、委託書和聲明對這些報告的任何聲明。在合理可行的情況下，這些報告可透過公司網站 www.eaton.com 免費取得。這些文件也可以在 SEC 網站 www.sec.gov 上取得。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"Principal methods of competition in these segments are performance of products and systems, technology, customer service and support, and price. Eaton has a strong competitive position in these segments and, with respect to many products, is considered among the market leaders. In normal economic cycles, sales of these segments are historically lower in the first quarter and higher in the third and fourth quarters of a specific year. In 2025, 22% of these segments' sales were made to six large customers of electrical products and electrical systems and services.","zh":"這些細分市場的主要競爭方式是產品和系統的性能、技術、客戶服務和支援以及價格。伊頓在這些領域擁有強大的競爭地位，並且在許多產品方面被認為是市場領導者。在正常的經濟週期中，這些細分市場的銷售額歷來在第一季較低，在特定年份的第三季和第四季較高。到 2025 年，這些細分市場 22% 的銷售額將銷往六大電氣產品、電氣系統和服務客戶。"}],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Electrical Americas","val":13276000000,"zh":"電氣美洲分部"},{"name":"Electrical Global","val":6815000000,"zh":"電氣全球部門"},{"name":"Aerospace","val":4249000000,"zh":"航空航太部門"},{"name":"Vehicle","val":2505000000,"zh":"車輛部門"},{"name":"E Mobility","val":604000000,"zh":"電動車部門"}],"total":27448000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":17122000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Europe","val":5078000000,"zh":"歐洲"},{"name":"Asia Pacific","val":2704000000,"zh":"亞太"},{"name":"Latin America","val":1461000000,"zh":"拉丁美洲"},{"name":"CA","val":1083000000,"zh":"加拿大"}],"total":27448000000}},"peers":["EMR","PWR","VRT","CMI","GEV"]}}